the precious souls who did not . Remembrance lives deeply within our own shared Canadian the memories of grandparents and loved ones who answered the call in world wars, conflicts, and peacekeeping missions across the globe. We honour the quiet dignity of those who returned home, the steadfast hearts of those currently serving in uniform, and the hidden sacrifices of

